---
const posts = (await Astro.glob('../content/posts/*.md')).sort((a,b) => b.frontmatter.date.localeCompare(a.frontmatter.date));
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="记录 Java 后端、Agent 与工程实践，在学习和实践中持续成长。"/><title>知行之间 · Java、Agent 与工程实践</title><style is:global>
:root{font-family: "PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:#252824;background:#f7f7f2;font-synthesis:none;scroll-behavior:smooth}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:0 36px}.top{height:78px;border-bottom:1px solid #dedfd8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-family:serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em}.mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;background:#456b55;color:white;border-radius:3px;font:17px serif}.nav{display:flex;gap:34px;font-size:13px;color:#646963}.nav a:hover,.text-link:hover{color:#416a52}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:65px;padding:102px 0 92px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#547960}.hero h1{font-family:"Songti SC","STSong",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,72px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:24px 0}.hero h1 span{color:#66836c}.intro{color:#717871;font-size:15px;line-height:2.1;max-width:455px}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;margin-top:35px;font-size:13px}.primary{background:#42694f;color:white;padding:14px 23px;border-radius:3px}.hero-art{background:#e9ede5;min-height:300px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:28px;color:#6b7e6a}.hero-art:before,.hero-art:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid #b6c7b2;border-radius:50%;width:290px;height:290px;right:36px;top:-75px}.hero-art:after{width:200px;height:200px;right:82px;top:-30px}.art-line{position:absolute;right:75px;top:105px;font-family:serif;font-size:105px;color:#8da590;opacity:.68}.art-caption{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.12em}.section{border-top:1px solid #dedfd8;padding:52px 0 65px}.heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:31px}.heading h2{font:600 27px "Songti SC",serif;margin:8px 0 0}.small{font-size:11px;color:#8c918b;letter-spacing:.08em}.text-link{font-size:12px;color:#66766a}.topics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.topic{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e9ebe5;padding:24px;min-height:146px}.topic .num{color:#9eafa0;font:12px Georgia}.topic h3{font:600 17px serif;margin:24px 0 10px}.topic p{font-size:12px;color:#999f97;margin:0}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr auto;gap:25px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e5de;align-items:start}.date,.tag{font-size:11px;color:#8a9389}.row h3{font:600 20px serif;margin:0 0 12px}.row p{font-size:13px;color:#888e87;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.tag{border:1px solid #dce4db;border-radius:30px;padding:6px 10px;color:#69806e}.about{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;align-items:center}.about p{font-size:14px;color:#777e76;line-height:2;max-width:600px}.footer{border-top:1px solid #dedfd8;padding:28px 0;color:#9b9f98;font-size:11px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.empty{color:#a0a69f;font-size:12px;margin-top:16px}@media(max-width:700px){.wrap{padding:0 22px}.top{height:68px}.nav{gap:12px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px;padding:65px 0}.hero-art{min-height:220px}.topics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.row .tag{justify-self:start}.about{display:block}.heading h2{font-size:24px}}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><header class="top"><a class="brand" href={base}><span class="mark">知</span> 知行之间</a><nav class="nav"><a href="#writing">文章</a><a href={`${base}topics/`}>专题</a><a href="#about">关于</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">NOTES ON LEARNING &amp; BUILDING</div><h1>在知与行之间，<br/><span>慢慢生长。</span></h1><p class="intro">记录 Java 后端、Agent 与工程实践。<br/>把复杂的问题想清楚，把走过的路写下来。</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#writing">开始阅读　↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#about">关于这个小站　→</a></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="art-line">行</div><div class="art-caption">KNOWLEDGE IN PRACTICE<br/>THOUGHTS, CODE &amp; BEYOND</div></div></section><section class="section" id="topics"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">EXPLORE BY TOPIC</div><h2>从感兴趣的地方开始</h2></div><span class="small">持续整理中</span></div><div class="topics"><a class="topic" href={`${base}topics/#java`}><span class="num">01 /</span><h3>Java 后端</h3><p>基础、框架与系统设计</p></a><a class="topic" href={`${base}topics/#agent`}><span class="num">02 /</span><h3>Agent 与 AI</h3><p>原理、应用与工程实践</p></a><a class="topic" href={`${base}topics/#interview`}><span class="num">03 /</span><h3>面试准备</h3><p>知识梳理与表达练习</p></a><a class="topic" href={`${base}topics/#notes`}><span class="num">04 /</span><h3>工程随笔</h3><p>问题、复盘与思考</p></a></div></section><section class="section" id="writing"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LATEST WRITING</div><h2>最近的记录</h2></div><span class="small">{String(posts.length).padStart(2,'0')} 篇文章</span></div>{posts.map(post => <a class="row" href={`${base}posts/${post.file.split('/').pop().replace(/\.md$/, '')}/`}><span class="date">{post.frontmatter.date}</span><div><h3>{post.frontmatter.title}　↗</h3><p>{post.frontmatter.description}</p></div><span class="tag">{post.frontmatter.category}</span></a>)}<p class="empty">新的思考，正在路上。</p></section><section class="section about" id="about"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS SPACE</div><h2 style="font:600 27px serif">关于知行之间</h2><p>这里是一个记录学习与实践的地方。没有速成的答案，只有对问题保持好奇、对经验认真求证，以及一点一滴的积累。</p></div><span class="text-link">学以致用，行以求知。 ↗</span></section></main><footer class="footer"><span>© 2026 知行之间</span><span>MADE FOR LEARNING, BUILT TO LAST.</span></footer></div></body></html>
